, {"file_name": "Screenshots5.png", "id": "33433009486297729", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_33433009509631060_8233866292253421935_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVqumgkXiqQQ7kNvwHKOgAi&_nc_oc=AdoLD3ypItwunX2ZfwB9u-I0g65DiFL_wqpAp6UaSyaAj5lW0Tyml5Q2fuLjbNVPN-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDoqHbB-0SHX9NQg1MtRgv_QWzm0VF2CpFKYQ8Y01bvg&oe=6AA692EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "logo video.png", "id": "1157342109927605", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821725_1157342113260938_5053254329938512617_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sVuOMhEE_JMQ7kNvwE0wWpA&_nc_oc=AdocnU0nq4oJ1Wvhday5YGfSZ8mXqgkNYc6-xG0BBaW9VZ38FE6tjhh0KZJWKwwokII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKr6pyO6CuiD__Vj0VRIa7KUTa_elXlAavQuCC0FYObTg&oe=6AA6C24D"}, "display_name": "VR Holy Bible", "keywords": ["bible"], "long_description": "A mixed reality Bible that offers a complete experience with multiple versions in English and Spanish.\n\nYou can use either your hands or the meta quest controls to use the application.\n\nNote: To perform a click with handtracking, bring the index finger and thumb together. Watch the video to fully understand the gesture in action.\n\n#### **English Versions (9 available):**\n- **KJV** - King James Version\n- **KJV with Strong's** - King James Version with Strong's Numbers\n- **ASV** - American Standard Version\n- **ASV with Strong's** - American Standard Version (Strong's Numbers)\n- **WEB** - World English Bible\n- **Bishops** - Bishops of the Bible\n- **Coverdale** - Coverdale Bible\n- **Geneva** - Geneva Bible\n- **Tyndale** - Tyndale Bible\n\n#### **Spanish Versions (5 available):**\n- **RVG** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez\n- **RVG 2004** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez 2004\n- **RV 1909** - Reina Valera 1909\n- **RV 1909 with Strong's** - Reina Valera 1909 (with Strong's Numbers)\n- **Holy** - Holy Scriptures\n\n### **Audio Bible in English (KJV)**\n### Available audio:\n-The four Gospels in audio format", "short_description": "Holy Bible in mixed reality and hand-tracking with several book versions in English and Spanish."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1023817693486147", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Santa Biblia en realidad mixta", "keywords": ["Biblia"], "long_description": "Una Biblia de realidad mixta que ofrece una experiencia completa con m\u00faltiples versiones en ingl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol.\n\nSe puede usar tanto las manos o controles de la meta quest para usar la aplicaci\u00f3n.\n\nNota: Para realizar un clic con handtracking, une el dedo \u00edndice con el pulgar. Mira el video para comprender mejor c\u00f3mo funciona el gesto en acci\u00f3n.\n\n#### **Versiones en ingl\u00e9s (9 disponibles):**\n\n- **KJV** - Versi\u00f3n King James\n\n- **KJV con Strong's** - Versi\u00f3n King James con n\u00fameros de Strong\n\n- **ASV** - Versi\u00f3n Est\u00e1ndar Americana\n\n- **ASV con Strong's** - Versi\u00f3n Est\u00e1ndar Americana (con n\u00fameros de Strong)\n\n- **WEB** - Biblia Mundial en Ingl\u00e9s\n\n- **Biblia de los Obispos** - Obispos de la Biblia\n\n- **Coverdale** - Biblia Coverdale\n\n- **Ginebra** - Biblia de Ginebra\n\n- **Tyndale** - Biblia Tyndale\n\n#### **Versiones en espa\u00f1ol (5 disponibles):**\n\n- **RVG** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez\n\n- **RVG 2004** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez 2004\n\n- **RV 1909** - Reina Valera 1909\n\n- **RV 1909 con Strong's** - Reina Valera 1909 (con n\u00fameros de Strong) n\u00fameros)\n\n- **Santo** - Sagradas Escrituras\n\n#### **Biblia en audio en ingles (KJV)**\nAudio disponibles: \n-  Los cuatro Evangelios en formato de audio\n", "short_description": "Santa Biblia en realidad mixta y seguimiento de manos con varias versiones del libro en ingl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol."}]}, "developer_name": null